<http://data.silknow.org/object/af6835e6-d5e6-3e83-b358-20107f8dd79c/observation/3>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A silk, woven, patterned lampas.  A ground of 5:1 twill, Z direction. Pattern is created using lance effects of the supplementary, coloured wefts. The design is floral. The pattern is bound on the front by the binding warp in a 1:2 twill, Z direction, over ½ of the [double] warp ends.\n\nWarp\nRatio 2 (doubles):1\n1)\tground\n\tsilk, 1-ply, S twist, seems to be arranged as 2 doubles and 1 single\n\tcream\n\tapp. 108 ends cm\n2)\tbinding\n\tsilk, 1 ply, STA\n\tcream\n\nWeft\nRatio 1:1\n1)\tground \n\tsilk, x-ply, STA, thick\n\tcream\n\tapp.  24 picks cm\n2)\tsupplementary lance\n\tsilk, x-ply, STA, thick\n\tlight green and dark green, orange, peach, white, red, pink"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/af6835e6-d5e6-3e83-b358-20107f8dd79c> .

<http://data.silknow.org/event/42671901-f9bc-3d73-967f-91a371a7fbb3>
